    "locales": {
      "en": {
        "name": "HK 337 .300 Blackout assault rifle",
        "shortName": "HK 337",
        "description": "The HK337 is a further development of the HK416A5 assault rifle in the .300 Blackout and .300 Whisper calibers. The most striking changes compared to its previous versions as well as to market available AR platforms include an improved and tool-less gas regulator for suppressor use, a redesigned, user-friendly lower receiver, which allows complete ambidextrous operation of the weapon and ensures optimised magazine compatibility. Additionally, numerous technical improvements to maximize the safety of the operator, weapon reliability, ammunition compatibility, and durability under real operating conditions."
      }
    },
